  "change": "Local ground update within every fresh cut, fused GPU face/constraint preparation and batched geometry checks. The material law, physical dt rule, recutting frequency, grouping rule and boundary law are unchanged.",
  "implementation": [
    "Keep the complete original cut at the current state. Collect the complete incident-face stars of cells touched by the ground; leave all other current-state volumes and cap moments in place.",
    "At the late state, second-pass sphere integration visits 140 cells and gathers 803 wall disks, instead of 7690 cells and 50406 wall disks. Hidden/empty cells are included conservatively.",
    "Prepare selected faces, floor disks and clipping constraints in fused Warp kernels. Omit only half-planes strictly containing the whole disk, keeping conservative slack near tangency.",
    "Check negative clipped area and impossible volume increases as before, with one batched host read.",
    "GroundClip(local=False) retains the full-field reference. Existing non-ground geometry paths keep non-indexed kernel calls."
